      "overview": {
        "en": "The AT4 is a battle-proven, single-use 84mm rocket launcher serving as the definitive solution to hardened targets and armored threats. This disposable heavy ordnance system delivers a high-explosive warhead capable of punching through reinforced concrete, light vehicle armor, and entrenched enemy positions with catastrophic effect. The AT4's simple point-and-fire design ensures rapid deployment under fire, though its powerful backblast demands strict spatial discipline from the operator and surrounding squad members. When the mission calls for overwhelming explosive force and no second chances, the AT4 provides a one-shot guarantee: whatever is in the crosshairs will not survive the impact.",
        "tc": "AT4 是一款為 CQB 近距離室內交火精心打造的高性能槍械，具備高度改裝擴充潛力。",
        "sc": "AT4 是一款为 CQB 近距离室内交火精心打造的高性能枪械，具备高度改装扩充潜力。"
      },
