      "overview": {
        "en": "The AKM is a time-tested assault rifle platform, revered globally for its rugged reliability and formidable stopping power. Chambered in high-caliber ballistics, the AKM provides aggressive suppression capabilities and exceptional performance in close to mid-range engagements. While it demands discipline to manage its characteristic recoil, the AKM rewards the operator with unparalleled lethality. Its modular top-cover and muzzle interface allow for tactical modernization, ensuring this classic workhorse remains a dominant force in contemporary combat scenarios.",
        "tc": "AKM 是一款為 CQB 近距離室內交火精心打造的高性能槍械，具備高度改裝擴充潛力。",
        "sc": "AKM 是一款为 CQB 近距离室内交火精心打造的高性能枪械，具备高度改装扩充潜力。"
      },
