      "overview": {
        "en": "The DW-556 is a versatile, semi-automatic rifle platform engineered for precision fire and reliable performance across a variety of tactical combat environments. Its balanced internal cycling makes it an ideal primary weapon for operators who value target accuracy over raw volume of fire. Highly modular, the DW-556 supports an extensive ecosystem of tactical attachments—ranging from precision long-range optics and muzzle-compensation devices to stabilization hardware and specialized ammunition configurations—ensuring operational excellence whether in the field or during rapid urban engagements.",
        "tc": "DW-556 是一款為 CQB 近距離室內交火精心打造的高性能槍械，具備高度改裝擴充潛力。",
        "sc": "DW-556 是一款为 CQB 近距离室内交火精心打造的高性能枪械，具备高度改装扩充潜力。"
      },
