      "overview": {
        "en": "The FM-9 is a specialized assault rifle platform meticulously re-engineered to fire high-impact .45 ACP ammunition. Born from the legendary Fabrique Militaire production lines, this primary weapon merges the ergonomic versatility of an assault rifle with the brutal stopping power of a heavy-caliber pistol round. Its updated internal assembly is designed for reliable cycling of larger casings, providing unmatched suppression at close-to-mid range. The modular rail system supports a wide array of tactical optics, muzzle brakes optimized for .45 caliber harmonics, and advanced stabilization hardware for precision delivery of its heavy-hitting payload.",
        "tc": "FM-9 是一款為 CQB 近距離室內交火精心打造的高性能槍械，具備高度改裝擴充潛力。",
        "sc": "FM-9 是一款为 CQB 近距离室内交火精心打造的高性能枪械，具备高度改装扩充潜力。"
      },
