      "overview": {
        "en": "The Hammer MK4 is a premier, full-scale automatic assault rifle platform engineered for high-intensity combat operations. Renowned for its unparalleled reliability and modularity, the MK4 serves as the foundation for modern infantry units operating outside standard contract frameworks. Its robust receiver supports an extensive array of field modifications, allowing operators to fully customize their loadout with advanced optics, muzzle brakes, stabilization grips, and mission-specific ammunition profiles to dominate any engagement theater.",
        "tc": "Hammer MK4 是一款為 CQB 近距離室內交火精心打造的高性能槍械，具備高度改裝擴充潛力。",
        "sc": "Hammer MK4 是一款为 CQB 近距离室内交火精心打造的高性能枪械，具备高度改装扩充潜力。"
      },
