      "overview": {
        "en": "The Hammer G12 is a powerful, semi-automatic 12-gauge shotgun platform designed for aggressive tactical breaching and close-quarters suppression. Operating outside standard corporate contract specifications, this primary weapon delivers consistent, high-impact firepower with minimal cycle delay. Its heavy-duty frame is built for total field modularity, supporting a wide range of tactical optics, choke-optimized muzzle devices, under-barrel stability grips, and specialized shotgun shell payloads tailored for any breach requirement.",
        "tc": "Hammer G12 是一款為 CQB 近距離室內交火精心打造的高性能槍械，具備高度改裝擴充潛力。",
        "sc": "Hammer G12 是一款为 CQB 近距离室内交火精心打造的高性能枪械，具备高度改装扩充潜力。"
      },
