      "overview": {
        "en": "The IWC-12SL is a specialized, semi-automatic shotgun operating on a unique inertia-driven bolt system. Engineered for high-impact precision, this platform swaps traditional shot spread for heavy, solid slug rounds, offering mechanics a bridge between devastating close-range stopping power and accurate mid-range threat elimination. Its mechanical cycling requires strict recoil management, but compensates with a rapid fire rate compared to pump-action or single-shot configurations.",
        "tc": "IWC-12SL 是一款為 CQB 近距離室內交火精心打造的高性能槍械，具備高度改裝擴充潛力。",
        "sc": "IWC-12SL 是一款为 CQB 近距离室内交火精心打造的高性能枪械，具备高度改装扩充潜力。"
      },
