      "overview": {
        "en": "The R-500M is a modernized, magazine-fed tactical shotgun based on the Mossberg 590M platform, developed under the joint Ravenwood Armaments & Redline Group contract. Featuring a high-capacity 10-round detachable box magazine, this variant departs from the traditional tubular magazine design to drastically reduce reload times in high-stress close-quarters environments. Engineered for sustained suppression and rapid follow-up shots, the R-500M retains the legendary stopping power and rugged pump-action reliability of the standard R-500 while offering superior tactical flexibility. It is the ultimate choice for operators who demand relentless firepower, swift ammunition transitions, and the combat effectiveness of a proven 10-round capacity during intense breach operations.",
        "tc": "R-500M 是一款為 CQB 近距離室內交火精心打造的高性能槍械，具備高度改裝擴充潛力。",
        "sc": "R-500M 是一款为 CQB 近距离室内交火精心打造的高性能枪械，具备高度改装扩充潜力。"
      },
