            "tc": "The Mossberg 590M is an American 12-gauge pump-action shotgun based on the Mossberg 590 platform. Unlike conventional tube-fed shotguns, it uses a detachable box magazine, with capacities of 5, 10, 15, or 20 shells depending on the magazine.Mossberg Model 590M",
            "sc": "The Mossberg 590M is an American 12-gauge pump-action shotgun based on the Mossberg 590 platform. Unlike conventional tube-fed shotguns, it uses a detachable box magazine, with capacities of 5, 10, 15, or 20 shells depending on the magazine.Mossberg Model 590M"
