      "overview": {
        "en": "M320 Hornets Nest is a powerful, single-shot secondary shotgun modified from a grenade launcher. Instead of traditional explosives, it fires a massive wall of high-velocity buckshot. Functioning essentially as a pocket-sized room-clearing tool, a single trigger pull close-up is guaranteed to instantly wipe out a tight corridor or a crowd of enemies. It is unmatched in point-blank engagements but requires a full reload after every single shot.",
        "tc": "M320 Hornets Nest 是一款為 CQB 近距離室內交火精心打造的高性能槍械，具備高度改裝擴充潛力。",
        "sc": "M320 Hornets Nest 是一款为 CQB 近距离室内交火精心打造的高性能枪械，具备高度改装扩充潜力。"
      },
