      "overview": {
        "en": "The R-500S is a tactical compact shotgun based on the Mossberg 590 Shockwave platform, developed under the Ravenwood Armaments & Redline Group contract as a secondary breach and emergency response weapon. Distinguished by its distinctive tan finish and aggressive sawed-off style grip, this shortened derivative of the R-500 prioritizes rapid accessibility and close-quarters dominance over sustained firepower. With its reduced barrel length, optimized pump action, and ergonomic pistol grip configuration, the R-500S delivers maximum terminal impact in confined spaces while maintaining the reliability and raw stopping power that defines the R-500 series. Built for operators who need a dependable backup system that can clear rooms, breach barriers, and neutralize threats at point-blank range when their primary weapon is unavailable.",
        "tc": "R-500S 是一款為 CQB 近距離室內交火精心打造的高性能槍械，具備高度改裝擴充潛力。",
        "sc": "R-500S 是一款为 CQB 近距离室内交火精心打造的高性能枪械，具备高度改装扩充潜力。"
      },
